   Q('mcq', 'Why did the theory lose support during the twentieth century?', 'A', "dinosaurs didn't seem to have collarbones, which birds have", 'Dinosaurs seemed to lack collarbones.', opts=['A bone found in birds appeared to be missing in dinosaurs.', 'Archaeopteryx was shown to be a fake.', 'No new fossils were found.']),
